app/services/realtime/engine.py adapts the rolling-window, stable-prefix decoding
method for native asynchronous vLLM scheduling. Modifications include per-session
cancellation, sample-position-based window trimming, whitespace preservation,
bounded memory, and final decoding at exact chunk boundaries.

